"VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAEEncode", "title": "VAE Encode (img2img - connect to KSampler1)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [334.5494079589844, 58], "pos": [50, 1160], "id": 23, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#422", "widgets_values": ["Krea2 Game Scene Concept Art Workflow v1\n职位: AI场景美术师 / 场景概念图生成\n架构参考: Aaalice Workflow v1.5 潜空间放大\n\n=== 适用场景 ===\n1. 前期概念探索: 根据主美文字描述快速生成场景概念图、情绪板、光影氛围图\n2. 草图转精细: 上传线稿/白模(Blockout)，img2img模式生成精细渲染\n3. 风格化转换: 搭配LoRA实现特定游戏风格(魂系/原神/UE5/赛博朋克/奇幻)\n4. 概念定稿输出: 三段潜空间放大+超分 输出2K级概念图供评审\n\n=== 三段式潜空间放大管线 ===\nKSampler 1: 1024x576 (16:9), steps=8, denoise=1.0\n  -> 基础构图、大关系、整体氛围\n  -> LatentUpscaleBy1 (nearest-exact, 1.5x -> 1536x864)\nKSampler 2: steps=8, denoise=0.45\n  -> 建筑结构细化、材质层次\n  -> LatentUpscaleBy2 (nearest-exact, 1.5x -> 2304x1296)\nKSampler 3: steps=8, denoise=0.3\n  -> 微细节、光影抛光、氛围颗粒\n  -> VAEDecode -> 4x-UltraSharp超分 -> ImageScale(2048x1152) -> SaveImage\n\n=== 提示词模板结构 (七段式) ===\n1. 质量词 + 画师/风格参考 (top 3 lines)\n2. 场景类型 + 核心主体 (scene type)\n3. 建筑/结构细节 (architecture)\n4. 植被/道具/装饰 (vegetation & props)\n5. 光影系统 (lighting) - 最重要！\n6. 构图/镜头 (composition)\n7. 氛围/情绪 (atmosphere)\n8. 游戏风格 (game style reference)\n\n=== LoRA 搭配建议 ===\n使用 Power Lora Loader (rgthree) + LoRAManager:\n- Slot 1: 风格LoRA (风格主导, weight 0.6-0.8)\n  如: ghibli style, dark souls style, cyberpunk style\n- Slot 2: 场景LoRA (环境材质, weight 0.5-0.7)\n  如: fantasy environment, sci-fi corridor, ancient temple\n- Slot 3: 细节/材质LoRA (增强质感, weight 0.4-0.6)\n  如: PBR texture, realistic material, cinematic lighting\n\n=== img2img 模式 (草图/白模转渲染) ===\n1. 上传草图/白模到 LoadImage(21)\n2. 断开 EmptyLatentImage(9) -> KSampler1(10) 的latent连接\n3. 连接 VAEEncode(23) LATENT -> KSampler1(10) latent_image\n4. 设置 KSampler1 denoise:\n   - 线稿转场景: 0.7-0.8 (保留构图, 大量生成)\n   - 白模转渲染: 0.5-0.6 (保留结构, 材质光影)\n   - 风格迁移: 0.4-0.5 (保留内容, 换风格)\n\n=== 分辨率预设 (修改 EmptyLatentImage) ===\n- 宽幅概念图: 1024x576  (16:9, 基础尺寸)\n- 竖幅场景: 576x1024  (竖向深渊/高塔)\n- 正方形环境: 832x832  (室内/圆形场景)\n- 超宽屏: 1216x512    (21:9 电影感)\n注: 最终输出 = 基础 x 2.25 (两次1.5x潜放) + 4x超分后缩到2K\n\n=== 场景风格关键词库 ===\n奇幻: fantasy, elven, dwarven, ancient temple, magical forest, crystal cave\n科幻: sci-fi, cyberpunk, neon city, space station, alien planet, futuristic\n末日: post-apocalyptic, ruined city, overgrown ruins, wasteland, desert\n恐怖: horror, abandoned, dark dungeon, haunted, foggy graveyard, decrepit\n国风: chinese traditional, ancient china, pagoda, bamboo forest, misty mountain\n现代: modern city, urban street, downtown, skyscraper, rooftop view\n\n=== Krea2 参数说明 ===\n- steps=8 (turbo模型专用, 速度快)\n- CFG=1.0 (Krea2需要低CFG, 高了会过曝)\n- sampler=euler, scheduler=simple (Krea2官方推荐)\n- CLIPLoader type=krea2 (使用Qwen3-VL 12层特征)\n- 放大方式: 优先潜空间放大(质量更好), 最后一步用图像超分补细节\n\n=== 质量自检清单 ===\n[ ] 构图: 前景/中景/背景层次分明, 有视觉引导线\n[ ] 光影: 明确的主光源方向, 有明暗对比, 体积光/丁达尔\n[ ] 材质: 不同材质区分清晰(石头/木头/金属/水/植被)\n[ ] 细节: 近景有丰富纹理, 远景有空气透视\n[ ] 色彩: 主色调明确, 有对比色点缀, 整体色调统一\n[ ] 氛围: 情绪明确(神秘/壮观/温馨/压抑)\n[ ] 比例: 建筑/道具比例合理, 有参照尺度"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Scene Concept Workflow Guide", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#633", "size": [370, 500], "pos": [50, 1270], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [34], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["example.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "Reference (Sketch/Blockout - for img2img)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 314], "pos": [50, 700], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [3, 4], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_vae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAELoader", "title": "VAE (Main)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 58], "pos": [50, 400], "id": 3, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [1], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Krea2-Turbo-FP8.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "title": "Krea2 Turbo (Scene Concept)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 82], "pos": [50, 100], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [23], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [1536, 768, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "title": "Empty Latent (1024x576, 16:9 widescreen)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [315, 106], "pos": [1030, 100], "id": 9, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [2], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "krea2", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "title": "CLIP (type=krea2, Qwen3-VL)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 106], "pos": [50, 250], "id": 2, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [14], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["low quality, worst quality, deformed, blurry, pixelated,\ntext artifacts, watermark, signature, logo, jpeg artifacts, noisy, grainy,\nsketch, rough lines, chibi, simple flat shading, amateur,\ncropped, out of frame, bad composition,\noversaturated, underexposed, overexposed, washed out,\nflat lighting, no depth, no atmosphere,\nduplicate elements, repeated patterns, tiling,\nbroken perspective, wrong scale, inconsistent light direction,\n3d render look, plastic texture, cgi look,\npeople, characters, human figures, animals, creatures (unless specified),\nfloating objects, physics errors,\nempty scene, barren, too clean, new looking,\ncartoonish style, anime style (unless specified),\nphotorealistic photo, real person, real location,\nbad architecture, impossible geometry, floating buildings,\nlow detail textures, blurry materials,\nmonochrome, grayscale, sepia,\nhdr halo, lens flare abuse, bloom overexposure"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Negative Prompt (Scene-specific)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [550, 180], "pos": [430, 730], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [13], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed, extremely detailed, 8k uhd, highres, absurdres,\nanime game environment, game scene background, in-game location concept,\nby genshin impact art team, by wuthering waves art team, official game promotional environment art,\ncel-shaded painting, hard shadow shading, vibrant game palette, painterly anime background,\n\n=== SCENE TYPE ===\nancient overgrown ruins of a wind god temple, nestled in a misty mountain valley,\na worn stone pathway leading through crumbling archways toward a central sanctuary,\nglowing wind crystals embedded in the ground marking a trail,\nsacred tree at the center with translucent floating leaves,\nbroken bridge on the right side connecting to a collapsed tower,\na small offering shrine with lit candles and a stone bowl of crystal water,\n\n=== ARCHITECTURE ===\nceltic-inspired fantasy temple ruins, weathered sandstone blocks with moss-filled cracks,\nornate pillar stumps carved with wind motif reliefs,\nsemicircular arches partially collapsed, some still holding vine-covered lintels,\nstone staircase descending into an underground chamber visible on the left,\nintricate floor tile patterns partially exposed through overgrown grass,\na circular ritual platform with carved runes glowing faint teal,\nwooden bridge planks over a chasm on the right, ropes frayed but intact,\n\n=== VEGETATION & PROPS ===\ngiant ancient tree with twisted trunk, sprawling roots breaking through stone,\ntranslucent pale green leaves with soft glow, floating petals caught in upward draft,\nclimbing vines and ivy wrapping around every column and wall,\nclusters of blue glowing mushrooms along the path edges (game item nodes),\ntall mountain grass swaying, scattered wildflowers in purple and white,\na small wooden chest half-hidden behind a pillar (game interactable),\nwind chimes made of crystal shards hanging from branches,\nfloating rocks suspended in the air near the central tree, anti-gravity effect,\n\n=== LIGHTING ===\nprimary light source: soft diffused daylight from above, overcast mountain sky,\nsecondary: teal-green glow from wind crystals and runes on the ground,\nambient: pale green mist filling lower areas, atmospheric depth gradient,\ngod rays filtering through tree canopy creating dappled light on the path,\nstrong rim light on the central tree and floating rocks, silhouette glow,\nwarm candle glow from the offering shrine, small warm light pool,\nshadow areas are soft and blue-green, not pure black — game-friendly visibility,\noverall flat-ish lighting with clear value separation for gameplay readability,\nno harsh contrast — everything remains visible and navigable,\n\n=== COMPOSITION ===\ngame environment establishing shot, eye-level player perspective,\ncentral path leading the eye from foreground to the sanctuary — strong leading lines,\nforeground: broken archway frame and path edge crystals, slight depth of field blur,\nmidground: main temple area with tree, platform, and shrine — sharp focus,\nbackground: mountain valley and distant floating islands fading into mist,\nasymmetrical balance with tree on center-right and collapsed tower on left,\npath curves gently to create exploration intrigue — what's around the bend?\nframing: foliage and archway on the edges creating natural vignette,\nwide 16:9 or 2:1 panoramic composition for game environment showcase,\n\n=== ATMOSPHERE ===\nsacred and serene, a forgotten place of worship reclaimed by nature,\ngentle wind always present, petals and leaves drifting upward,\nmystical teal-green energy permeating the air near the central tree,\nsoft mountain fog rolling in from the valley,\na sense of ancient power dormant but not gone,\ncolor palette: warm sandstone beige, teal-green glow, soft purple shadows, white highlights,\nmood: peaceful exploration, wonder, quiet mystery, no danger felt,\n\n=== GAME STYLE ===\ngenshin impact environment art style, wuthering waves scene painting,\ncel-shaded architecture with painted texture details,\nvibrant but slightly desaturated colors, no photorealism,\nclean readable silhouettes for all interactive objects,\npbr-lite material rendering, hand-painted texture feel,\nstylized shadows with soft edges, no harsh contact shadows,\nsubsurface glow on vegetation and crystals,\ngame-optimized detail density — more detail near path, less in distance,\nofficial game location art quality, screenshot-ready composition\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Positive Prompt (Game Scene Concept Template)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [550, 350], "pos": [430, 350], "id": 5, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [5, 6, 7], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [9, 10], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [0.4000000000000001, true, "Krea2snowFstyle_c1-st8000.safetensors", 0.20000000000000004, 1.0000000000000002, "Krea2SnowZZZ_c1-st8000.safetensors", 1, 0.8000000000000002, "tutu_c1-st2000.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 1, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 2, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_weight_1"}, "name": "model_weight_1", "label": "model_weight_1", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "model_weight_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "clip_weight_1"}, "name": "clip_weight_1", "label": "clip_weight_1", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "clip_weight_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name_1"}, "name": "lora_name_1", "label": "lora_name_1", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_weight_2"}, "name": "model_weight_2", "label": "model_weight_2", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "model_weight_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "clip_weight_2"}, "name": "clip_weight_2", "label": "clip_weight_2", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "clip_weight_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name_2"}, "name": "lora_name_2", "label": "lora_name_2", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_weight_3"}, "name": "model_weight_3", "label": "model_weight_3", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "model_weight_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "clip_weight_3"}, "name": "clip_weight_3", "label": "clip_weight_3", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "clip_weight_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name_3"}, "name": "lora_name_3", "label": "lora_name_3", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name_3"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Power Lora Loader (rgthree)", "title": "LoRA Manager (Style/Scene/Detail LoRAs)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [350, 270], "pos": [441.28955078125, 17.210487365722656], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "rgthree", "ver": "0.33.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Power Lora Loader (rgthree)"}, "order": 10}], "extr